00:06:54.181 --> 00:06:59.983
Customers browse restaurants that deliver to their address, with ETA, fees, ratings and offers.

115
00:07:00.263 --> 00:07:05.554
They can search dishes or restaurants and filter (veg, rating, delivery time, offers).

116
00:07:05.834 --> 00:07:06.581
Menu.

117
00:07:06.861 --> 00:07:13.069
Shows items with variants and add-ons, availability (out of stock, time-based menus) and pricing.

118
