The address is validated and the ETA promise shown.

121
00:07:25.456 --> 00:07:30.363
Payment options are UPI, cards, wallets and cash on delivery (COD).

122
00:07:30.643 --> 00:07:31.581
Order flow.

123
00:07:31.861 --> 00:07:32.821
Order placed.

124
