131
00:07:47.907 --> 00:07:48.846
Changes.

132
00:07:49.126 --> 00:07:54.033
Customers can cancel before the restaurant accepts, or later under policy with fees.

133
00:07:54.313 --> 00:08:01.075
Restaurants can reject orders or mark items unavailable, which triggers substitution or a partial refund.

134
