Receive an assignment and accept it, or have it auto-accepted with a rejection limit.

137
00:08:10.455 --> 00:08:12.012
Navigate to the restaurant.

138
00:08:12.292 --> 00:08:15.023
Pick up with an OTP or order ID check.

139
00:08:15.303 --> 00:08:18.247
Deliver, with an OTP for high-value orders.

140
00:08:18.527 --> 00:08:20.681
Collect COD cash and track earnings.

141
00:08:20.961 --> 00:08:21.836
Support.

142
00:08:22.116 --> 00:08:29.519
Self-serve resolution for missing or wrong items and late delivery, with images, refunds or credits, and escalation.

143
