Restaurant payouts with commission and taxes deducted, on a weekly or more frequent cycle.

146
00:08:41.671 --> 00:08:45.319
Rider payouts made up of per-order pay, incentives and tips.

147
00:08:46.669 --> 00:08:47.779
Non-functional.

148
00:08:48.059 --> 00:08:49.403
Here is a quick table:

149
00:08:49.683 --> 00:08:51.048
Attribute, and Target.

150
00:08:51.328 --> 00:09:00.352
ETA accuracy: for example, 85 to 90% of orders delivered within the promised window, with mean absolute error of a few minutes.

151
00:09:00.632 --> 00:09:01.720
Feed latency:

152
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.027
P95 300 ms.

153
00:09:04.307 --> 00:09:05.331
Order placement:

154
00:09:05.611 --> 00:09:09.984
P95 1 s; exactly-once payment and order creation.

155
00:09:10.264 --> 00:09:11.544
Dispatch latency:

156
00:09:11.824 --> 00:09:18.629
Rider assigned within ~1 to 2 minutes of acceptance (or timed to food readiness, §6.4).

157
00:09:18.909 --> 00:09:20.104
Tracking freshness:

158
00:09:20.384 --> 00:09:24.459
Rider location on the customer's map updated every few seconds.

159
00:09:24.739 --> 00:09:25.805
Availability:

160
00:09:26.085 --> 00:09:33.125
Order placement and the restaurant and rider apps at 99.95%; graceful degradation at peak.

161
00:09:34.475 --> 00:09:35.521
Peak handling:

162
